{"v":4,"catch":"合成聲音傳來，與宇宙海盜的戰鬥即將開始！","desc":"《BOSCONIAN》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1981年發行的射擊遊戲。\n控制一架太空巡邏機並打倒太空海盜BOSCONIAN！\n敵方基地可以通過摧毀所有砲塔或向基地中心發射導彈來摧毀，這會引起大規模爆炸。\n在一輪中摧毀所有敵人基地以清除每個階段。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-08-24","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c076b8ac809bda6d350de97bb7efeedcc69f7b45d7f2f932e3269191b59e45e5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4220aa1524623c4810ec11dea82cfc4ccffb561a5fc1e1f336256b6dd638789e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/737868d9bc54e93c7309f5c18b6b95e1e8b7d5805bca334b48b9639096d8ff62.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e458f59fc7cdc424ff221890ce3851678684f0658a07a995212cf56c277a8075.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf51b86a72e8d60cc64fc5bdb9c9e87fb11c357a904b2c4901f3ffd0a5d7a9fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/09969ba90622ccf0ab2ab2a159a1443b64ecb543166eebe2d74d6fbd4a22f8db.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ec101bcec000","dlc":[]}